<title>NEW ZEALAND: Ceramco names new Bendon Hickory CEO.</title>
<headline>Ceramco names new Bendon Hickory CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apparel and ceramics manufacturer Ceramco Corp said on Monday Hugo Venter had been appointed chief executive of apparel subsidiary Bendon Hickory.</p>
<p>Prior to the appointment Venter was primarily involved in the apparel retail trade, Ceramco said in a statement.</p>
<p>Venter would assume his new role immediately.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
